  <p>We try to answer legitimate notes within 48 to 72 business hours.</p>
  <h2>Accounts, funding, and refunds</h2>
  <p>Dispatch Cove does not sell the factoring programs, load-board subscriptions, or software mentioned in the guides. We do not take payment, fund invoices, or keep a vendor’s account records. If a purchase, a fee, or a funded invoice is in dispute, contact that company. We cannot look up the transaction or issue a refund.</p>
  <h2>Privacy of your email</h2>
  <p>If you email us, we use that address to reply. Please do not send passwords, full payment card numbers, or other sensitive financial information.</p>
